# An allow-list. A checkout's root holds live databases and the secret key
# (tapedeck.key, scrobbles.db, tapedeck.db, everynoise.db), logs, temp/ and a
# multi-gigabyte target/ — none of which may reach a build context.
*

!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!build.rs
!src/
!assets/
!web/

# Built or installed inside the image.
web/node_modules/
web/.svelte-kit/
web/build/
